1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,467
Every day, we click.
Setiap hari, kita klik.

2
00:00:01,467 --> 00:00:02,467
We scroll.
Kita skrol.

3
00:00:02,467 --> 00:00:03,400
We shop.
Kita membeli-belah.

4
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:04,733
We transfer money.
Kita pindahkan wang.

5
00:00:04,733 --> 00:00:07,033
We share our personal information.
Kita kongsi maklumat peribadi.

6
00:00:07,067 --> 00:00:08,967
But… are we really safe?
Tapi… adakah kita benar-benar selamat?

7
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:12,300
One message. One call. One click.
Satu mesej. Satu panggilan. Satu klik.

8
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:17,333
And maybe… all your personal information is exposed.
Dan mungkin… semua maklumat peribadi anda terdedah.

9
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:28,667
Di Malaysia, 28,698 kes jenayah telekomunikasi direkodkan dari Januari hingga November 2025.
In Malaysia, 28,698 telecommunication crime cases were recorded from January to November 2025.

10
00:00:28,667 --> 00:00:34,200
Dan golongan 21 hingga 30 tahun mencatat jumlah mangsa tertinggi.
And those aged 21 to 30 recorded the highest number of victims.

11
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:37,967
Welcome to the world of CYBERSECURITY.
Selamat datang ke dunia keselamatan siber.

12
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:40,200
It's not just about hackers.
Ia bukan sekadar tentang penggodam.

13
00:00:40,267 --> 00:00:42,533
It's about protecting your identity,
Ia tentang melindungi identiti anda,

14
00:00:42,533 --> 00:00:43,600
your data,
data anda,

15
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:44,733
your money…
wang anda…

16
00:00:44,733 --> 00:00:46,567
and your digital life.
dan kehidupan digital anda.

17
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:49,833
So, here's the question…
Jadi, persoalannya…

18
00:00:50,500 --> 00:00:52,567
Are you really PROTECTED?
Adakah anda benar-benar dilindungi?
